<Base lang="hi" title="UP Scholarship 2026-27: November me verification ka schedule — kab kya hoga" description="UP Scholarship 2026-27 ke Dashmottar fresh aur renewal aavedanon ki November verification dates — NIC scrutiny, university verification, correction window aur payment ki poori list।" path="/blog/up-scholarship-verification-november-2026/" altPath="/en/blog/up-scholarship-verification-november-2026/" faqs={faqs} updated="6 नवंबर 2026" datePublished="2026-11-06" dateModified="2026-11-06">
<div class="content-col"><h1 class="page-title">UP Scholarship 2026-27: November me verification ka schedule</h1>
<p class="note">नोट: यह वेबसाइट एक स्वतंत्र जानकारी गाइड है — इसका आधिकारिक पोर्टल edistrict.up.gov.in से कोई संबंध नहीं है।</p>
<p class="updated-line">Official schedule (scholarship.up.gov.in) ke mutabiq · November 2026</p>
<figure class="blog-featured"><img src="/images/blog/up-scholarship-verification-november-2026-featured.webp" alt="UP Scholarship November 2026 verification (example illustration)" /><figcaption>उदाहरण चित्र • Illustration — edistrictupseva.com</figcaption></figure>
<section class="box"><h2>November me kya ho raha hai</h2><p>October me form bharne ka kaam khatam ho gaya — ab November verification ka mahina hai। Neeche har kaam ki aakhri date hai:</p><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Kaam</th><th>Kaun</th><th>Kab tak</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Institution verification aur forwarding</td><td>Dashmottar Fresh</td><td>10 नवंबर 2026</td></tr><tr><td>University / affiliating body verification</td><td>Dashmottar Fresh</td><td>25 नवंबर 2026</td></tr><tr><td>NIC scrutiny</td><td>Dashmottar Renewal</td><td>6–20 नवंबर 2026</td></tr><tr><td>University verification</td><td>Dashmottar Renewal</td><td>5 नवंबर 2026</td></tr><tr><td>NIC scrutiny</td><td>Pre / Post-Matric Fresh</td><td>6–15 नवंबर 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Correction window</td><td>Dashmottar Renewal + Inter</td><td>21 नवंबर–20 दिसंबर 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Correction window</td><td>Dashmottar Fresh</td><td>16 दिसंबर 2026–10 जनवरी 2027</td></tr><tr><td>Pehle phase ki payment (PFMS)</td><td>—</td><td>21–31 दिसंबर 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="note">Dates official schedule ke mutabiq hain — kisi bhi badlav ke liye scholarship.up.gov.in hi final hai।</div><figure class="shot"><img src="/images/blog/scholarship-timeline.svg" alt="UP Scholarship November 2026 verification timeline" /><figcaption>November 2026 verification timeline — edistrictupseva.com</figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Teen categories — alag-alag dates</h2><p>UP Scholarship ek scheme nahi hai, teen alag categories hain aur har ek ka schedule alag hai:</p><ul><li><strong>Pre-Matric (Class 9–10):</strong> chhoti class ke students ke liye। Fresh aavedanon ki District School Inspector (DIOS) se verification 5 नवंबर 2026 tak thi, aur NIC scrutiny 6–15 नवंबर 2026 chal rahi hai।</li><li><strong>Post-Matric Inter (Class 11–12):</strong> Intermediate students ke liye। In ki correction window Dashmottar Renewal ke saath 21 नवंबर–20 दिसंबर 2026 hai।</li><li><strong>Dashmottar (Post-Matric, Class 12 ke baad):</strong> degree, diploma, ITI aur B.Ed jaise courses ke liye — ye sab se badi category hai। Fresh aavedan 31 October 2026 tak bhare gaye aur renewal 15 October 2026 tak।</li></ul><p>Apni category pehchan lein — galat category ki dates dekh kar pareshan hone se behtar hai ke apne form par likhi category ke hisaab se schedule dekhein।</p></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Verification ke stages — step by step</h2><p>Form jama karne ke baad aapka aavedan in marhalon se guzarta hai:</p><ol><li><strong>Institution verification:</strong> aapka college ya school form check karke aage bhejta hai — Dashmottar Fresh ke liye ye 10 नवंबर 2026 tak hona hai। Agar college ne abhi tak forward nahi kiya to turant college se sampark karein।</li><li><strong>University / DIOS verification:</strong> university ya zila adhikari genuine students ki verification karte hain aur galat aavedan block karte hain।</li><li><strong>NIC scrutiny:</strong> National Informatics Centre data ki jaanch karta hai — Renewal ke liye 6–20 नवंबर aur Fresh ke liye 26 नवंबर–5 दिसंबर 2026।</li><li><strong>Data lock aur demand creation:</strong> Renewal ke liye data lock 21–26 नवंबर aur demand creation 27–30 नवंबर 2026 hai — is ke baad payment ki tayyari shuru hoti hai।</li><li><strong>Payment (PFMS):</strong> pehle phase ki payment 21–31 दिसंबर 2026 ke beech PFMS se DBT ke zariye Aadhaar-linked bank account me aani hai।</li></ol><p>Fresh aavedanon me shak wale ya galat data ki rectification 6–31 दिसंबर 2026 ke beech hoti hai।</p></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Agar verification ruk jaye to kya karein</h2><p>Agar aapka status lambe waqt se ek hi marhale par ruka hai to pehle apne college ya school se poochhein ke form forward hua ya nahi — Dashmottar Fresh ke liye institution verification ki aakhri date 10 नवंबर 2026 hai। Us ke baad university ya affiliating body se rabta karein। NIC scrutiny ke marhale me aapko kuch nahi karna hota, lekin agar status me "suspicious data" ya verification failed dikhe to correction window ka intezar karein aur apni category ki dates note kar lein — window khatam hone ke baad ghalti theek karne ka mauka nahi milta।</p></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Status aur payment kaise check karein</h2><p>Do alag jagah check karni hoti hai — form ka status aur payment ka status alag hain:</p><ul><li><strong>Form ka status:</strong> scholarship.up.gov.in par "Status" khol kar application number se dekhein — wahan verification ka marhala dikhega।</li><li><strong>Payment ka status:</strong> PFMS portal (pfms.nic.in) par "Know Your Payment" se check karein — bank ka naam aur account number chahiye hota hai।</li><li><strong>College se poochhein:</strong> district verification 16 October–5 नवंबर 2026 ke beech thi — agar institute ne form forward nahi kiya to status aage nahi badhega, is liye college se confirm kar lein।</li></ul></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Aadhaar verification failed ho to</h2><p>Agar aapke form me "Aadhaar Demographic Verification Failed" dikh raha hai to ghabrayein nahi — ye aam taur par naam, pita/mata ka naam, janm tithi, category, marks, income ya bank account ki ghalti se hota hai। In sab ko official <strong>Sanshodhan (Correction) window</strong> me theek kiya ja sakta hai — upar wali table me apni category ki window dekhein। Aadhaar record sahi ho to form theek karein, form sahi ho to Aadhaar record theek karwayein। Window khatam hone ke baad correction ka mauka nahi milta, is liye dates miss na karein।</p></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Payment kaise aati hai</h2><p>Scholarship ki raqam seedha DBT se aapke <strong>Aadhaar-linked bank account</strong> me aati hai — beech me koi agent nahi hota। Is liye do cheezein pehle se pakki kar lein: bank account Aadhaar se linked ho, aur form me likha account number sahi ho। Agar account Aadhaar se linked nahi hai to payment ruk sakti hai — bank jaa kar Aadhaar seeding karwayein। Pehle phase ki payment 21–31 दिसंबर 2026 scheduled hai, aur Class 9–12 renewal students ki payment 25–31 October 2026 ke beech shuru ho chuki thi।</p></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Income certificate ka link</h2><p>Scholarship ke liye income certificate chahiye hota hai — agar aapka abhi tak nahi bana ya purana ho gaya hai to <a href="/income-certificate/">आय प्रमाण पत्र गाइड</a> se documents aur process dekh lein। Income certificate aam taur par 3 saal ke liye valid hota hai, lekin scholarship ke liye fresh income details ki zaroorat hoti hai — form me likhi income aur certificate ki income me antar na ho, warna verification me rukavat aati hai।</p></section></div></Base>
